Error [jet.UnknownName]: `show` needs `total`, which the script hasn't set yet here
  --> tests/ui/script_function_called_before_its_variable_is_set.jet:9:1
    |
  9 | show()
    | ^^^^
  --> tests/ui/script_function_called_before_its_variable_is_set.jet:10:1
    |
 10 | total: 5
    | ^^^^^ `total` is set here
 Why: `show` uses the script's `total` through `label`, so each call passes it, and this call runs before the line that sets it
 Fix: Move this call below the line that sets `total`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0107
